<title>ITALY: Italian total bank lending rose 3.3 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Italian total bank lending rose 3.3 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian total bank lending rose 3.3 percent year-on-year in April, the Bank of Italy said in a statement. It issued the following provisional year-on-year percentage changes:</p>
<p>			April 1997    March 1997    April 1996</p>
<p>Total bank lending  +3.3%	   +2.5% (r)     +2.4%</p>
<p>Lira bank lending   +3.4%	   +2.8% (r)     +5.5%</p>
<p>Deposits		-0.5%	   +0.8% (r)     +2.8%</p>
<p>Note - (r) denotes revised figure.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
